      "created_at": "2012-11-30T20:10:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Spiff\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/48/1865_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Spiff:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It's a good suggestion, but I wouldn't be surprised if the hp tracker cards are a dead issue at this point.&nbsp; The new hp and effect tokens pretty much handle that issue and seem to be the prefered solution from &gt;G's point of view.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Also its the fact that tokens are expandable so they do not have to print more HP trackers for future Heroes.</p>\n<p>Though if they posted ones that people can print off by themselves it would just be awesome(As part of the Download section).</p>",
